n (above the 2% gate)."],"hlth":["Leverage is heavy at 6.5x net debt to EBITDA ($6.5M of cash against $616.3M of debt), and interest cover is thin at 1.3x.","Warning signs: an Altman Z of 1.09 in the distress zone."],"growth":["Revenue has compounded at 22.0% over 3 years, 21.5% over 5 years and 13.3% over 10 years, and it has been lumpy (year-to-year swings of 26%).","Forward indicators: FFO growth of 30.7% a year over five years.","Capex runs 13.3x depreciation (467.9% of sales), so it is building capacity for future growth."],"own":["Insiders own 8.8%, meaningful skin in the game, and institutions hold 66%.","It returns 7.3% a year to shareholders (1.1% in buybacks and 7.5% in dividends).","The share count has grown 16.9% a year over five years, diluting existing holders.","It pays out 136% of earnings, more than it earns, so the dividend is at risk."],"people":["With about 42 employees, each generates about $3.6M of revenue, 1.6x the Real Estate median.","CEO pay is $2.1M (1x revenue per employee), and compensation governance scores well (2/10, lower is better).","Stock compensation averages $99K per employee."]},"profile":{"v":"AVOID","conv":40,"head":"Avoid: priced 193% above its fair value of $6.94.","pros":["Revenue grew 21.5%/yr over 5y","P/E 18.1x vs sector 23.9x","5 analysts' mean target $23.60 (+16%)","12-1 month momentum +29%","Returns 7.3% a year to shareholders"],"cons":["Trades 193% above fair value of $6.94","ROIC 2.6% vs WACC 6.5%","Net debt/EBITDA 6.5x","Interest coverage only 1.3x"],"flags":["Priced 193% above its fair value of $6.94","Operating income covers interest only 1.3x"],"need":[],"buy_below":5.9,"vc":{"base":6.94,"base_src":"blend","bear":null,"bull":null,"alt_median":6.94,"n_alt":3,"gap":null,"dispersion":0.2714,"level":"MEDIUM","why":[]},"med":{"pe":23.8785,"ev_ebitda":16.1705,"pfcf":17.849,"pb":1.3551,"roic":0.0405,"gross_margin":0.5564,"fcf_margin":0.1712,"div_yield":0.0475}},"ticker":"CTO","date":"2026-11-13"}